      "caption": "Referring to FIG. 1 , a rechargeable battery 1000 according to an embodiment may include an electrode assembly including a positive electrode 114 , a negative electrode 112 (facing the positive electrode 114 ), a separator 113 (interposed between the positive electrode 114 and negative electrode 112 ), an electrolyte solution (not shown), a battery case 115 (accommodating the electrode assembly), and a sealing member 116 (sealing the battery case 115 ). FIG. 1 shows a cylindrical rechargeable battery as an example; embodiments may be applied to other types of batteries, e.g., prismatic, etc.",
